    q("python", "medium", ["oop"], "How would you design Python classes for a text classification pipeline with a preprocessor and a model?", "Create a Preprocessor class with fit and transform and a Model class with train and predict, then a Pipeline class that connects them so the same preprocessing is used in training and prediction. Keep each part testable.", ["Fit/transform and train/predict", "One pipeline object", "Same preprocessing everywhere"], ["Why does scikit-learn use this pattern?"]),
