    q("nlp", "medium", ["tf-idf", "embeddings"], "Compare TF-IDF with word embeddings for representing text.", "TF-IDF counts words weighted by how rare they are, is sparse and ignores meaning, while embeddings are dense vectors that place similar meanings close together. TF-IDF is a fast strong baseline and embeddings capture semantics.", ["Sparse counts vs dense meaning", "TF-IDF baseline", "Embeddings capture similarity"], ["When would TF-IDF still win?"]),
