    q("rag", "medium", ["retrieval"], "Why combine keyword search with vector search in a RAG system?", "Vector search finds meaning but can miss exact terms such as names, codes or numbers, while keyword search finds exact matches. A hybrid search with re-ranking gets the best of both.", ["Semantic vs exact matching", "Hybrid retrieval", "Re-ranking"], ["What does a re-ranker do?"]),
    q("agents", "hard", ["tools", "safety"], "What controls would you put on an AI agent that can call tools such as email or a database?", "Give it the least privilege, require human approval for risky actions, validate tool inputs, limit the number of steps and cost, log every action and defend against prompt injection from retrieved content.", ["Least privilege and approval", "Step and cost limits", "Logging and prompt-injection defence"], ["How would you test the agent's safety?"]),
